cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EquiMed-DSS, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "EquiMed-DSS: a Python library for clinical-AI fairness assessment"
abstract: >-
  EquiMed-DSS is a Python library for clinical artificial-intelligence fairness
  assessment. It implements 37 metrics across five domains (reliability and
  robustness, fairness and ethics, governance and transparency, representation
  and robustness, and a technical-supplement fairness suite) plus a geographic
  equity module, each reported as a point estimate with a 95% confidence
  interval.
type: software
